  "id": "metalinguistic-awareness",
  "term": "metalinguistic awareness",
  "definition": "Metalinguistic awareness is the ability to think about language as an object and consciously work with its structural features. It includes awareness of sounds, word parts, and written patterns, and is linked to vocabulary and literacy development across one or more languages.",
